            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.31

- Added the same smooth, continuous marquee behavior to long artist and collaborator names.
- Kept short artist names stationary and fully visible while preserving the artist line's existing typography.
- Artist scrolling independently respects overflow and the macOS Reduce Motion setting.
]]></description>
